        "date_posted": "",
        "is_remote": false,
        "description": "**Hiring Flutter Developer \\- Hybrid in Karachi** \n\n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n**About Client Company:** \n\n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n Leading Software Development and IT Solution Provider in Pakistan.\n \n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n**Job Description:** \n\n\n\n* Develop and maintain advanced mobile applications using Flutter.\n* Collaborate with designers, product managers, and backend developers to define and implement new features.\n* Integrate third\\-party APIs and external data sources.\n* Optimize application performance, responsiveness, and user experience.\n* Troubleshoot and resolve bugs and bottlenecks in a timely manner.\n* Maintain high standards of code quality, testing, and documentation.\n* Participate in code reviews and contribute to a culture of continuous improvement.\n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n**Requirements:** \n\n\n\n* 1\\+ years of mobile app development experience( junior or mid level)\n* Strong hands\\-on experience with Flutter \\& Dart\n* Solid understanding of state management (Provider, Bloc, Riverpod, etc.)\n* Experience with Firebase and backend integrations\n* Strong knowledge of REST APIs and JSON\n* Experience with Git (version control systems)\n* Strong problem\\-solving skills\n* Ability to work independently and manage multiple tasks\n* Experience publishing apps on App Store \\& Play Store\n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n**Other Details:** \n\n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n**Working Timings: 12:00PM\\-8:00PM** \n\n\n\n\n**Working Days: Mon\\-Fri (Alternate Saturdays On)** \n\n\n\n\n**Work Mode: Full Time Onsite** \n\n\n\n\n**Location: Gulshan e Iqbal, KHI**",
